        "title": "DC Case Number API",
        "description": "API provides list of cases from a court establishment matching the Case Registration Number. Input for this API is the Establishment Code, Case Registration Number , Case Registrati on Year, and other details. Case Registration number consists of Case Type/Registration Number/Registration Year. Registration Number input is optional, and if not provided, will give list of all cases of the given case type and registration year."
